warning[P2G4080]: the pattern is built from `$pat` at run time, so it compiles
    at run time too
  --> logwatch.pl:31:21
   |
31 |     my $re = qr/$pat/;
   |                     ^^
   |
   = cost: `MustCompile` cannot be used, so the emitted code handles a compile
           error as a value on every call
   = try: hoist the pattern to a package-level `regexp.MustCompile` wherever the
          text turns out to be constant
   = learn: mustcompile-pattern   (perl2golang explain mustcompile-pattern)
   = learn: errors-are-values   (perl2golang explain errors-are-values)
